   "note": "Route B with guard 73 (p-records-office-73) killed on his walk to the public door and left where he fell. Re-sited 2026-10-19 (Waymark, brief 023; engine 0.8.2 crowd.pace): the kill is timed to his arrival, the first tick he is within takedown reach, not a pinned tick (refused since crowd.pace), at a spot a finder passes, on the square north of the Office: killed at 4:29.8, unseen; his missed 5:30 mark is Alert 1; guard 64 (p-records-office-64) walking back to the Office finds him at 7:35.2 and radios it in, unstopped, landing at 7:40.2 after the Take: a win at Alert 2, 3 T + 6 T campaign + an open case (12 T in total) against route B's 3 T at Alert 0 (MC-7: worse, not failed).",
