  "knowledge": {
    "rule": "a person knows a fact only if they witnessed it (§05: a clear sightline within 13 m) or were told it along a tie. At the start nobody knows anything about the cell (person.memoryAtStart). The one thing a person starts knowing about others is listed in needsKnown. The cell is known by face only: a witness remembers the Fixer's face (§03), never a name.",
