   },
   "src": "brief 013 D; Motive 013 §6.1 G-fast",
   "note": "The informed route G (the primary): the knockout at 2:01, the moment the rerouted patrol leaves the door's sweep; the 2:30 mark is missed while the Enforcer is inside (Alert 1: at level 2 the dock's robots reach only places within 60 m, and the patrol is away), so Motive's gamble (robots on the forecourt as he comes out) does not bite on this block."
  },
  {
