   },
   "src": "brief 013 D; Motive 013 §6.1 G-kill; Keel N47",
   "note": "Route G with a kill, the body carried to the Office's service door and put through it: never found in the mission; a missing person in the debrief (+2 T, no Menace, an open case, the block hardens)."
  },
  {
   "id": "loud",
   "file": "loud.json",
   "plan": "loud.plan.json",
   "kind": "loud",
   "route": "A",
   "primary": true,
   "expects": {
    "outcome": "success"
   },
   "src": "GDD §07 loud; Keel N10",
   "note": "The reference loud (brief 013 D, re-authored for the takedown engine at security level 2): the guard shot just after his 2:30 check-in mark; the Scout and Fixer return fire only until the final fight (the response unit now comes from the Office's doors and reaches the car first), the Fixer at the pavilion's centre support (cv-094), out of its line; nobody is downed or captured."
  },
  {
   "id": "loud-fast",
   "file": "loud-fast.json",
   "kind": "loud",
   "route": "A",
   "expects": {
